            },
            "description": "No x-retell-signature header (no pre-request script on this one).\n\nToday: 200, and the fixture records signature_valid false. From D3/D4 this must become 401 - the other half of the enforcement regression test.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"call_started\",\n  \"call\": {\n    \"call_id\": \"call_postman_unsigned\",\n    \"call_type\": \"phone_call\",\n    \"direction\": \"inbound\",\n    \"agent_id\": \"{{agent_id}}\",\n    \"call_status\": \"ongoing\",\n    \"start_timestamp\": 1789450193999\n  }\n}",
